(* 43_use_files.lep - use: put functions in another file and pull it in.

   A `use` line with a quoted path includes that file, relative to the
   file that has the use line. In a project, a name path such as
   physics::drag includes src/physics/drag/module.lep or
   src/physics/drag.lep.
   Each file is included once, even when several files use it, and a
   function can be used before or after the place where it is written. *)

use "lib/robot_math.lep"

ensure speed = wheel_speed(0.1m, 2 / 1s)
show "wheel speed:" speed

show "stopping distance:" stopping_distance(speed, 2m / (1s * 1s))
